# NO LFS. Deliberately, and this file exists to say so.
#
# LFS pointers do not resolve over GitHub Pages: an LFS-tracked audio file is
# served as a ~130-byte text stub, and every podcast client fails differently
# with nothing reporting an error. If you are about to add a `filter=lfs` line
# here, the file you are adding belongs somewhere else.
#
# The explicit unset below makes the intent enforceable rather than merely
# documented — it prevents a global gitattributes or a well-meaning `git lfs
# track` from quietly capturing these paths.
* -filter -diff -merge
*.m4a -filter -diff -merge
*.mp3 -filter -diff -merge
*.mp4 -filter -diff -merge
*.wav -filter -diff -merge
